type: dataset
title: "FXMacroData open sample datasets"
abstract: "Historical snapshots of official US macroeconomic releases, G10 policy rate decisions and a release calendar sample, each with UTC release timestamps, for event studies, look-ahead-safe backtests and nowcasting tutorials."
